{"4313690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Son of Man", "steam_appid": 4313690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Jesus life like never before, as a son of man, of flesh and blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through 2,5 D scenarios of the 1st century Judea and Galilee, and see historical objects and places. — Recreated as faithfull as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work, sleep and eat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through the Sea of Galilee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make signs and heal the sick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass through temptations and nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in parties and play games like ancient Dreidel and others.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Jesus life like never before, as a son of man, of flesh and blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through 2,5 D scenarios of the 1st century Judea and Galilee, and see historical objects and places. — Recreated as faithfull as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work, sleep and eat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through the Sea of Galilee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make signs and heal the sick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass through temptations and nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in parties and play games like ancient Dreidel and others.</p>", "short_description": "Experience the last 3 years of Jesus through his eyes and the eyes of witnesses, walking through beautiful scenarios and solving puzzles in the historically accurated world of 1st century.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4313690/ed3b9f1053e9ecd1f080efdd8ab3a3b124093937/header.jpg?t=1778081473", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4313690/73161e00e38443d0bf05b3324e96